["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/invokedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Element was invoked by the `to` Agent, during a LifecycleScopeType period (for example, a /Build/Build element that describes a build step).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
